OL,3,GNEWSALabour and Green partnership
OL,4,Acollapses on council
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour has withdrawn from a coalition
OL,7,Fdeal with the Green Party on Sheffield
OL,8,FCity Council, just days after saying
OL,9,Fthe parties would continue to work
OL,10,Ftogether.
OL,12,FIt follows a bitter row after the
OL,13,Fnational Green Party adopted a policy
OL,14,Fdefining Zionism as a form of racism,
OL,15,Fwhich saw national Labour chiefs
OL,16,Ftelling 11 councils, including
OL,17,FSheffield, to break their power deals
OL,18,Fwith the Greens.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
