OL,3,GNEWSALabour and Green partnership
OL,4,Acollapses on council
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour Council leader Fran Belbin had
OL,7,Fignored pressure from the national
OL,8,Fparty and vowed a week ago to continue
OL,9,Fworking with the Greens, but has now
OL,10,Fsaid the joint administration "must
OL,11,Fcome to an end".
OL,13,FThe Greens accused Belbin of "reneging
OL,14,Fon her previous commitment to ensure a
OL,15,Fstable council for Sheffield".
